  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2>Influence of salinity level on sediment denitrification in a Louisiana estuary receiving diverted Mississippi River water</h2>
    <div class="authors-affiliations">
      <span data-field="author_1_name">{{ author_1_name }}</span><sup style="font-size: 0.7em;">a,b</sup>,
      <span data-field="author_2_name">{{ author_2_name }}</span><sup style="font-size: 0.7em;">c</sup>, and
      <span data-field="author_3_name">{{ author_3_name }}</span><sup style="font-size: 0.7em;">a</sup>
    </div>
    <div class="authors-affiliations" style="font-size: 9pt;">
      <span data-field="affiliation_1">{{ affiliation_1 }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="affiliation_2">{{ affiliation_2 }}</span>
